# Remote state backend configuration for the staging environment.
#
# Copy this file to backend.tf (which is gitignored) and uncomment ONE block
# matching the cloud provider you are targeting (AKS → AzureRM, EKS → S3).
#
# One-time setup steps are in docs/cloud-runtimes.md → "State Management".
#
# After creating/editing backend.tf, run:
#   terraform init -migrate-state

